# Shell scripts must stay LF. CRLF breaks bash on Windows (git-bash) checkouts.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Workflow and issue-template YAML stays LF. A Windows checkout that rewrites it
# to CRLF produces a whole-file diff for everyone with core.autocrlf off.
*.yml text eol=lf

# The language bar should describe the server, not its packaging. The README
# generator and the agent-harness config are both larger than src/ and would
# otherwise report this Python project as mostly JavaScript and shell.
scripts/readme/** linguist-documentation
assets/** linguist-documentation
.claude/** linguist-vendored
.agents/** linguist-vendored
.codex/** linguist-vendored
